Package: satweather
Version: {{VERSION}}
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Matthew Ackerman
Section: web
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.13), python3-venv
Description: GOES-18 HRIT / EMWIN weather viewer
 Parses and serves everything rtl's dish decodes from GOES-18: satellite
 imagery, EMWIN text products, radar mosaics and NWS graphics. Installs
 the backend to /opt/satweather/backend and the built web UI to
 /opt/satweather/web. The venv, systemd units, Apache vhost and database
 are managed by the satweather Salt state, not by this package.
